A held: dimmed, presses ''
A released: dimming, presses 'A'
A later: full
A held again: dimmed
A dragged off, still held: full
A released off it: full, presses 'A'
B held: default full, its opacity 0.5
B released: opacity 1, presses 'AB'
C (disabled) held: full, presses 'AB'
D held: default full, its opacity 0.7
D released: opacity 1, presses 'ABD'
A by Enter: dimmed, presses 'ABDA'
A after Enter: full
A under a finger: dimmed
A after the finger: full, presses 'ABDAA'
feedback off, A held: full
presses 'ABDAAA'
